{title: Arey Ruk Ja Re Bande}
{artist: Indian Ocean}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] [Ab],        Arey ruk jaa... arey tham jaa...
[Cm] [Ab]
Arey ruk jaa re bande, arey tham jaa re bande...
[Bb] [Cm],        Ki kudrat hans padegi ho...
[Cm] [Ab]
Are neendein hai jakhmi, are sapne hai bhooke
[Bb] [Cm],        Ki karvat phat padegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab]
Arey ruk jaa re bande, arey tham jaa re bande...
[Bb] [Cm],        Ki kudrat hans padegi ho...
[Cm] [Ab]
Are mandir ye chup hai, aray masjid ye gumsum
[Bb] [Cm],        Ibadat thak padegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab],        Samay ki lal aandhi, kabristan ke raaste
[Bb] [Cm],        Are latpath chalegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab],        Kise kafir kahega kise kayar kahega
[Bb] [Cm],        Teri kab tak chalegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab],        Kise kafir kahega kise kayar kahega
[Bb] [Cm],        Teri kab tak chalegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab]
Are mandir ye chup hai are masjid hai gumsum
[Bb] [Cm],        Ibadat thak padegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab],        Samay ki lal aandhi kabristan ke raste
[Bb] [Cm],        Are latpath chalegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab]
Are neendein hai jakhmi are sapne hai bhooke
[Bb] [Cm],        Ki karvat phat padegi ho.
[Cm] [Ab],        Yeh andhi chot teri kabhi ki sukh jaati
[Bb] [Cm],        Magar ab pak chalegi.
